the operator rejected, which reads as more table rather than as status. Colour,
size and label are untouched, so only the treatment is on trial.

Apply from the repo root: `git apply <this file>`; revert with `git apply -R`.

Reds: the badge-tone spec — a declared badge draws exactly what the ui Badge's
tonal treatment draws, and none of them the outlined one.

